<title>AUSTRIA: All OPEC ministers assembled for Thursday meeting.</title>
<headline>All OPEC ministers assembled for Thursday meeting.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>All OPEC ministers had assembled on Thursday for the start of the second, closed, session of their meeting, expected to end today.</p>
<p>Most minister said they expected to agree on a six-month rollover of the current 25.033 million barrels per day ceiling.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
